1
00:00:24,674 --> 00:00:26,674
How'd you get home last Night?
Sorry about that.

2
00:00:28,679 --> 00:00:30,679
Night sent me back.

3
00:00:38,617 --> 00:00:40,617
Earth, you're awake?

4
00:00:41,222 --> 00:00:43,222
Yes.

5
00:00:43,558 --> 00:00:45,558
Gun just called earlier.

6
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:47,381
Oh, okay.

7
00:00:48,383 --> 00:00:50,383
He just asked where you were.

8
00:00:51,963 --> 00:00:53,963
Oh, I see.

9
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:00,104
Don't go near that bastard.

10
00:01:01,972 --> 00:01:02,843
Who?

11
00:01:04,518 --> 00:01:06,518
Night. That guy.

12
00:01:14,165 --> 00:01:15,000
Why?

13
00:01:15,596 --> 00:01:16,775
I'll tell you later.

14
00:01:21,536 --> 00:01:22,424
What is it?

15
00:01:23,932 --> 00:01:25,932
Were you talking to Gun?

16
00:01:26,442 --> 00:01:29,297
No, I was talking to a friend.

17
00:01:33,773 --> 00:01:35,773
Tawan.

18
00:01:40,035 --> 00:01:42,035
The guy from last Night?

19
00:01:43,559 --> 00:01:45,559
Yes, why?

20
00:01:46,790 --> 00:01:48,790
It's just… uh…
